WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:09.710
Part two: the Levy packet. Every volunteer signs Levy's packet once a year. It takes about three minutes on your phone, with no printing.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:20.340
Step one. The packet opens by itself right after you sign up. Any other time, tap Sign the Levy packet online, on your volunteer page.

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:25.799
Step two. Your name and initials are already filled in. Check that they're right.

00:00:25.999 --> 00:00:31.580
Then check each policy. The full packet is linked at the top, if you want to read it.

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:39.492
Step three. Answer the health questions honestly. If you answer yes to any, the IU liaison will contact you.

00:00:39.692 --> 00:00:43.703
Sign with your finger or mouse, and check the box under your signature.

00:00:43.903 --> 00:00:46.200
Then tap Sign and submit.

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:53.570
Step four. Your signed packet files itself with your paperwork, and the IU liaison reviews it.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:01:03.730
Up next, part three: the minor release, for volunteers under eighteen. Eighteen or older? Skip ahead to part four, Creating Legends.
